{"seq":17,"trial_id":"shared-brain-access-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-installer-open-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-22T12:39:55.355Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d42dd35fb055272d54f73673d3c0188982a3f65b67d8b18c73af8f434f920fd5","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana, I went through Moss's notes in the shared files: the four North team digests and the two Central ones. Two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers come up:\n\n• *#4419*: from *Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)* (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea Ramaswell logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. The same note says it was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing.\n• *#PD-4492*: from *Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth* (5 Oct 2025, teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea submitted it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers on the 04:00 shift at Doors 14–18 in the Eau Claire yard weren't getting SMS bay assignments from the gatehouse kiosk. Support patched the SMS gateway routing at 19:30 that day, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct shift got through cleanly. The note also has a follow-up to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n\nMoss's other two North digests (9/14 pipeline and the 3/23 renewal check-in) mention QFL but don't give any ticket numbers.\n\nSome things to know before you paste this in:\n• #4419 also shows up in Marcus's own note, *Q2 expansion wrap* (14 Jul 2025), which isn't one of Moss's. He describes it as \"Gate 3 printer lag\" (a BOL printout delay), not the Door 14 scanner problem. It's the same number with two different descriptions, so it's worth checking which is right.\n• I left out #4409 and #4412 from Moss's Central handoff digest because they belong to Pree's dealer account, not QFL. I also left out #4092 from #north-random, which is an IT ticket for the Zoom room hub."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
